<mxCell id="h17" value="Grouped-query attention is the difference between a 40 GiB and a 320 GiB long-context bill. Count is weights + one request&#x27;s cache, before activations and fragmentation; four concurrent 131,072-token pastes add 160 GiB." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="270" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
